{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23766","headline":"酬令狐相公春日寻花见寄六韵 · 白居易","name":"酬令狐相公春日寻花见寄六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病卧帝王州，花时不得游。\n老应随日至，春肯爲人留。\n粉坏杏将谢，火繁桃尚稠。\n白飘僧院地，红落酒家楼。\n空里雪相似，晚来风不休。\n吟君怅望句，如到曲江头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}